OL,3,AUrgent review after two migrant boats
OL,4,Areach shore
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn urgent review has been ordered by
OL,7,Fthe home secretary after two migrant
OL,8,Fboats arrived on beaches in Kent
OL,9,Fwithout being intercepted at sea.
OL,11,FShabana Mahmood told Border Security
OL,12,FCommand to carry out the review after
OL,13,Fvessels came ashore at Samphire Hoe,
OL,14,Fbetween Dover and Folkestone, on
OL,15,FTuesday, and near Folkestone on Monday.
OL,17,FTwenty-one people were detained on
OL,18,FTuesday after the arrival at Samphire
OL,19,FHoe.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
